<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel rating cut by Cowen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel rating cut by Cowen.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said analyst Drew Peck cut his rating on Intel Corp to buy from strong buy, citing concerns about gross margins and revenue growth in the first quarter.</p>
<p>-- raised earnings estimate to $8.10 per share from $7.80 for 1997 and to $9.25 from $9.20 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares fell one to 146-1/8.</p>
</text>
